 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "9bb36114",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Economic Dispatch Using Linopy\n",
    "\n",
    "## Objective\n",
    "\n",
    "The objective is to determine the optimal generation dispatch of two power plants while satisfying the electricity demand at minimum generation cost.\n",
    "\n",
    "The problem is formulated as a linear optimisation problem and solved using Linopy."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "d5c2677e",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import linopy"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "id": "78be8f3e",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "dispatch_model = linopy.Model()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 3,
   "id": "d8ee3587",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "coal_gen = dispatch_model.add_variables(\n",
    "    lower=50,\n",
    "    name=\"coal_gen\"\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "gas_gen = dispatch_model.add_variables(\n",
    "    lower=100,\n",
    "    name=\"gas_gen\"\n",
    ")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 4,
   "id": "ab3e7a2e",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "Constraint `power_balance`\n",
       "--------------------------\n",
       "+1 coal_gen + 1 gas_gen = 500.0"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 4,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "demand = 500\n",
    "\n",
    "dispatch_model.add_constraints(\n",
    "    coal_gen + gas_gen == demand,\n",
    "    name=\"power_balance\"\n",
    ")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 5,
   "id": "15dc4eac",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "Constraint `gas_gen_upper_limit`\n",
       "--------------------------------\n",
       "+1 gas_gen ≤ 400.0"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 5,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "dispatch_model.add_constraints(\n",
    "    coal_gen <= 300,\n",
    "    name=\"coal_gen_upper_limit\"\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "dispatch_model.add_constraints(\n",
    "    gas_gen <= 400,\n",
    "    name=\"gas_gen_upper_limit\"\n",
    ")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 6,
   "id": "ed993550",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "dispatch_model.add_objective(\n",
    "    3 * coal_gen + 4 * gas_gen,\n",
    "    sense=\"min\"\n",
    ")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 7,
   "id": "5b1206ef",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Running HiGHS 1.11.0 (git hash: n/a): Copyright (c) 2025 HiGHS under MIT licence terms\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "('ok', 'optimal')"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 7,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "dispatch_model.solve(\n",
    "    solver_name=\"highs\",\n",
    "    output_flag=False\n",
    ")"
   ]
  },
